WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.678
Dearest reader,
did you miss me?

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.682
Forgive me, Mama.

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:17.976
Might I go promenade
for suitors with Eloise?

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:30.864
She has named Daphne

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:32.533
as the season's
Incomparable.

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:34.493
She calls you "a diamond
of the first water."

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.335
Flawless, my dear.

00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:00.602
I was smiling at the view,

00:01:00.686 --> 00:01:02.271
which you are now blocking.

00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:03.772
Mrs Thatcher.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.400
Your Majesty.

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:22.833
-Oh, Newton. Newton!
-Newton!

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.719
Over.

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:41.185
Best of luck to you, Robert.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:44.354
You shall certainly need it
this season.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.620
Which one is your pick,
my lord?

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:00.579
-Edwina.
-Nectar.

00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:08.295
Action!

00:02:12.049 --> 00:02:14.635
Come on! Come on!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.367
Here, allow me.

00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:55.551
A pleasing face,
an acceptable wit

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.303
and genteel manners enough
to credit a viscountess.

00:02:58.387 --> 00:02:59.721
That should not be
so hard to find.

00:02:59.805 --> 00:03:01.390
Do not tell us you are
hoping for a love match.

00:03:01.473 --> 00:03:03.141
Love is the last thing
I desire.

00:03:04.142 --> 00:03:06.019
But if my children
are to be of good stock,

00:03:06.103 --> 00:03:08.105
then their mother must be
of impeccable quality.

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:22.035
Mr Finch.

00:03:22.119 --> 00:03:23.871
Pardon me,
Miss Featherington.

00:03:24.538 --> 00:03:26.123
Oh, what a delectable frock.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.166
Almost the exact shade
of Double Gloucester

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.043
your mother served
at tea this afternoon.

00:03:30.127 --> 00:03:32.129
I so love cheese.

00:03:40.304 --> 00:03:44.183
Oh, I do relish a challenge.

00:04:32.564 --> 00:04:33.649
The Mallet of Death.

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:35.234
Would you look at that,
brother?

00:04:35.943 --> 00:04:36.944
Is this yours?

00:04:37.027 --> 00:04:38.654
No, no.
You're welcome to it.

00:04:38.737 --> 00:04:41.198
-You threatened to beat me--
-You exaggerate.

00:04:41.615 --> 00:04:43.075
Brother,
might I be able to join in

00:04:43.158 --> 00:04:44.576
on the fun this summer
at Aubrey Hall?

00:04:45.994 --> 00:04:47.704
Provided you stay clear
of my lucky mallet.

00:05:01.218 --> 00:05:02.594
If there is interest,
I can send word

00:05:02.678 --> 00:05:03.846
to my men on the ground
in Georgia.

00:05:03.929 --> 00:05:04.763
-Ah.
-Very good.

00:05:04.847 --> 00:05:06.807
I shall indeed marry
Prudence,

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:08.934
but you should know she's
marrying a penniless man.

00:05:09.393 --> 00:05:11.478
My loyalty is to the King
and Prince Arthur.

00:05:11.562 --> 00:05:14.022
There is nothing you can do
to change that.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:41.133
So many flowers,

00:05:42.134 --> 00:05:44.595
when what I really seek
is a gem.

00:05:57.316 --> 00:05:59.318
When one is frustrated,

00:05:59.401 --> 00:06:01.320
it is often much wiser

00:06:01.403 --> 00:06:04.072
to focus upon satisfying
one's own needs.

00:06:04.156 --> 00:06:07.117
Mama and I did the best
we could to raise Edwina,

00:06:07.201 --> 00:06:09.453
all so she would never know
of our struggles.

00:06:22.299 --> 00:06:23.383
What do you have
in your hand?

00:06:23.467 --> 00:06:24.801
Nothing, Mama.
It's only a pamphlet

00:06:24.885 --> 00:06:25.802
on new methods

00:06:25.886 --> 00:06:27.763
for the tidying of dogs,
apparently.

00:06:30.599 --> 00:06:32.017
I am sorry, Mama, but…

00:06:32.684 --> 00:06:34.436
I am attending a lecture
this afternoon.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.063
Flower arranging.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.205
Come on, then.
Is it Mondrich or Gillespie?

00:06:53.288 --> 00:06:54.915
Come on, one bet. One bet.

00:07:19.606 --> 00:07:23.527
&lt;i&gt;Oh dear!&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;What can the matter be?&lt;/i&gt;

